# Raw run output is tracked (configs, launch logs, per-episode JSONL/JSON summaries) so the
# paper's numbers are reproducible from the repo; the bulky per-step artifacts are not.
**/rollout/*/
**/traces/
**/*.mp4
**/*.jpg
**/wandb/
**/frames/
# Chained launch logs (Ray/progress noise, several MB each; each arm's launch.log is kept) and
# derived files over GitHub's 100 MB limit (aggregate.py rebuilds masks.parquet from the runs).
**/driver.log
**/driver.log.partial
token_prune/results/masks.parquet
